// ---------- Count sheet for printing / Excel ----------
// A blank sheet for counting by hand: items grouped by area (bar, kitchen, warehouse) and category, one column per storage spot of the area,
// prepared (composite) items in their own group. It shows no system quantity (blind count). The layout is a print aid only and never
